["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"PHP2Shell Won&#x27;t Be the Last Big AI Cybersecurity Risk minus one-day vulnerability centaur hacker formal verification Pass the Planet\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-30-oddlots-已知两年没人能利用的php漏洞-ai一天写出了攻击代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">49:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>已知兩年沒人能利用的PHP漏洞，AI一天寫出了攻擊代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">PHP基金會兩年前就知道這個漏洞，卻因為沒人能證明能利用它而擱置未修；AI一天內就寫出了遠程攻陷網站的完整攻擊代碼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WHOOP CEO, Will Ahmed: 50B Hours of Health Data, a 4 Million Member Data Moat, &amp; the FDA Fight HRV GLP-1 AFib 510(k) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-allin-血压监测算健康产品不算医疗器械-whoop硬刚fda赢了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/157d273f0c076aa6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>血壓監測算健康產品不算醫療器械，Whoop硬剛FDA贏了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whoop堅持把血壓監測算作健康功能而非醫療器械，頂住FDA一封警告信，最終促成FDA更新審批指南，血壓功能至今仍留在產品裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可穿戴設備</span><span class=\"tag\">訂閱制轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What I learned about power from LBJ and Robert Moses public authority unanimous consent agreement YIMBY\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-dwarkesh-没人选他-他却靠法案里一句话把权力焊进了宪法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c00f9336512a8100-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">24:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>沒人選他，他卻靠法案裡一句話把權力焊進了憲法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">羅伯特·摩斯從未當選任何公職，卻把徵收通行費、留存盈餘的權力寫進了債券合同——美國憲法保護合同不可侵犯，這一招讓他的權力比任何市長、州長的任期都更難撼動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">權力</span><span class=\"tag\">政治操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luke Muehlhauser on the most important AI safety work nobody is doing TEDAI neuralese reward hacking focused research organizations impact investing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-eightythousand-ai安全圈不缺钱-缺的是愿意辞职去当创始人的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c28893c5b3ed220c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全圈不缺錢，缺的是願意辭職去當創始人的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資金不是AI安全的瓶頸——會審查申請、願意辭職創業去填補「AI的FDA」「AI的NTSB」這類機構空白的人，才是真正稀缺的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">慈善資助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Preparing for a Career During in Age of Artificial Intelligence prestige trap case method experiential learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-mastersinbiz-哈佛商学院前院长-学生该做的不是用ai-是跟ai辩论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ceeab3e81fd72a7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">15:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛商學院前院長：學生該做的不是用AI，是跟AI辯論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他要求學生在課堂上大聲讀出AI給的答案，再說清楚哪裡同意、哪裡反對——這種帶著審問的協作，才是AI時代真正能帶進職場的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI與就業</span><span class=\"tag\">批判性思維</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Startups Rebuilding American Industry | The AD50 dual use valley of death co-engineering low mix high volume / high mix low volume AD50 manufacturing middle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-a16z-国防订单替美国工厂买单-受益的将是机器人和医疗设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>國防訂單替美國工廠買單，受益的將是機器人和醫療設備</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">國防合同替美國工廠礦山買單最貴的開廠成本，這些產能和工藝最終流向機器人、能源電網和消費品，而不只是武器本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">先進製造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Software engineering at Google &amp; CS education with Titus Winters Abseil AST readability review OpenRewrite zero token architecture\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-pragmatic-ai真正价值不是把活干得更快-而是去做以前想都不敢想的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3f9c9068b7bc84b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI真正價值不是把活幹得更快，而是去做以前想都不敢想的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現有生產力指標只會統計代碼行數和故障率，卻量不出團隊借AI啃下了一件以前覺得不值得、做不到的更難任務，這才是Titus Winters認為AI價值被低估的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Google工程文化</span><span class=\"tag\">大規模代碼重構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Taking on ServiceNow: Coding Agents the Rest of Us with Serval Co-Founder and CEO Jake Stauch TAM SDLC vibe coding ITSM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-nopriors-ai-智能体越聪明-大企业反而把权限收得更紧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b4599cbd3b872acf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體越聰明，大企業反而把權限收得更緊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jake Stauch 認為模型越強，權限濫用能造成的破壞就越大，企業只能把默認權限收到最小，再靠一層審批系統放行例外——這正是 Serval 要賣的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">編碼智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"How Do You Take a Picture of a Black Hole? VLBI (Very Long Baseline Interferometry) event horizon black hole mimicker frame dragging\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-thejoyofwhy-银河系自己的黑洞太活跃-第一张黑洞照片拍的是更远的m87/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b36fc769727aa196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Joy of Why</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>銀河系自己的黑洞太活躍，第一張黑洞照片拍的是更遠的M87</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">銀河系中心黑洞質量小、物質繞轉週期只有半小時，一夜之內形貌就會變；M87黑洞重達60億太陽質量，同一夜觀測裡幾乎靜止，反而更容易成像。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">天文觀測</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Conversation With The Wealthy Barber (Dave Chilton) | #433 RRSP TFSA RESP AUM model segregated fund RRSP meltdown strategy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-rationalreminder-自动储蓄的人不是以后才快乐-而是现在就更快乐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>自動儲蓄的人不是以後才快樂，而是現在就更快樂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做了40年理財教育之後，《The Wealthy Barber》作者發現：強制自動儲蓄不是用現在的剋制換未來的安穩，而是讓人當下就更少焦慮、更快樂——延遲滿足的傳統說法反而講反了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">金融顧問</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Manhattan Project, Take Two mirror imaging entity resolution RBAC/ABAC IL6 FinOps Genesis mission\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-chinatalk-美国政府的ai预算两年前就定死-却要追着算力账单跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e7ccc037b1d3a98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">45:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>美國政府的AI預算兩年前就定死，卻要追著算力賬單跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">國會撥款的預算週期要兩年起步，但大模型和算力賬單按月變化；真正的解法不是省錢，而是讓預算能在不同模型、不同用途之間打通調配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">聯邦政府AI</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Wall Street Really Thinks About the AI Trade Now neoclouds pod shop / multi-manager fund frontier sink AI factor open weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-oddlots-ai融资风险已摆在眼前-仍有四成投资者视而不见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">41:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI融資風險已擺在眼前，仍有四成投資者視而不見</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴克萊調查顯示只有60%的投資者認為AI融資會出問題，但CoreWeave、Cipher等公司近幾週的真實遭遇早已說明答案本該是100%，市場仍處在否認階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Shadows, war, and finding Moomin joy GARM The Groke Moomin Characters Oy Limited\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-throughline-姆明的第一本书只卖了219本-真正让它爆红的是第三本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1646x1646+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F26%2Fcc%2F0e9f396b43a2b6ae03ba86b3f606%2Fd3ab8c80-c449-4882-8644-470d9f6df324.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>姆明的第一本書只賣了219本，真正讓它爆紅的是第三本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姆明的前兩本書是她在二戰轟炸聲中寫下的末日寓言，幾乎無人問津；真正讓她成名的第三本不再直接寫戰爭，卻仍留了一個陰森角色提醒讀者恐懼從未真正消失。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芬蘭歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why SoftBank paid me 17 yen to skip the air conditioning demand response virtual power plant base load peaker plant stranded generation CapEx / OpEx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-complexsys-ai数据中心全天候运转-芯片折旧比电费贵5到10倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5cd9c21e737bb124-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">26:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>AI數據中心全天候運轉：芯片折舊比電費貴5到10倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的芯片折舊是電費的五到十倍，比特幣挖礦只有一點五到三倍，這個比例差決定了AI數據中心會全天候運行而不是像礦機那樣為省電隨時停機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電力市場</span><span class=\"tag\">虛擬電廠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Easter Island Moai Manavai Rano Raraku Pukao Tangata Manu Mata&#x27;a\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-ancients-复活节岛不是生态自杀-杀死人口的是欧洲瘟疫-不是滥伐森林/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a572716032db7f6f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>復活節島不是生態自殺：殺死人口的是歐洲瘟疫，不是濫伐森林</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">歐洲人在庫克船長抵達前四年已登島，帶來島民毫無免疫力的舊大陸疾病，真正摧毀人口的是這場瘟疫，而不是島民自己造成的森林濫伐。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古學</span><span class=\"tag\">太平洋史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Medieval Ghost Stories Purgatory Harlequin haunt Byland Abbey ghost stories\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-historyhit-新教没有赶走中世纪的鬼-只是换成了更凶的恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06ac7e08f7ad2c21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>新教沒有趕走中世紀的鬼，只是換成了更兇的惡魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新教徒說鬼魂是天主教迷信，但他們解釋靈異的辦法不是取消它，而是把討債的鬼換成了更危險的惡魔——詹姆斯六世1597年寫的《惡魔學》就是證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">鬼故事</span><span class=\"tag\">中世紀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"718. The Suez Crisis: Britain&#x27;s Shattered Empire (Part 2) special relationship Eisenhower Doctrine lie doggo\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-restishistory-苏伊士战场英法完胜埃及-真正让他们撤军的是美国一通电话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e06c9ce2b8657d9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>蘇伊士戰場英法完勝埃及，真正讓他們撤軍的是美國一通電話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法兩天內摧毀埃及空軍，地面戰線節節推進，卻因英鎊在美國施壓下瀕臨崩盤，被迫倉促下令停火撤軍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇伊士危機</span><span class=\"tag\">英美關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"408. JFK: Nixon, McCarthy, &amp; The Dark Side of Camelot (Part 2) Addison&#x27;s disease lobotomy Profiles in Courage\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-29-empirehist-肯尼迪意外输掉副总统候选提名-反而一夜成为全国新星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>肯尼迪意外輸掉副總統候選提名，反而一夜成為全國新星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1956年民主黨史無前例地把副總統提名交給大會代表現場票選，肯尼迪雖在最後一輪惜敗，卻因此第一次成為全國矚目的政治新星，還躲開了那年大選慘敗的責任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">政治史</span><span class=\"tag\">肯尼迪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E257｜對話Vitalik：AI安全背後的哲學思想，有效利他主義如何影響硅谷？ EA (Effective Altruism) e/acc d/acc Neglectedness P(doom) Orthogonality thesis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-sv101-vitalik锐评anthropic-安全话术与自身权力相关性超九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>Vitalik銳評Anthropic：安全話術與自身權力相關性超九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik捐出數億美元資助AI安全，如今卻說各家AI實驗室嘴上談安全，但他們實際做的事和擴張自身權力的相關性可能超過九成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">有效利他主義</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Can You Use AI To Make Good Art? — With Fred Graver Compound Engineering / Compound Writing thousand true fans because/therefore framework (Ken Adams) Flow\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-aiandi-ai能帮你写剧本-拍节目-却解决不了独立编剧找观众这件事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1445d3aa23a8588-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">50:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能幫你寫劇本、拍節目，卻解決不了獨立編劇找觀眾這件事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這位艾美獎編劇把創作拆成構思、製作、觸達觀眾三步，AI在前兩步已經很好用，但怎樣讓一千個觀眾願意為你每月付錢，目前還沒人搭好這套基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI寫作</span><span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The New Full-Stack Designer DialKit scroll jacking showstopper component Sidekick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-ycsp-ai能写出任何代码-却分不清什么好看什么难看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7a683c298b3b270-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI能寫出任何代碼，卻分不清什麼好看什麼難看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Shopify設計工作室負責人說，AI已經能執行任意技術複雜度，但審美判斷權仍在人手裡——他調一個輪播動畫用了91次提示，靠不斷挑剔而不是動手畫圖，把關最終效果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI協作</span><span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"He Learned to Code on Paper. Now He&#x27;s Fixing the Internet. | Chai Choudhary, Workers Formal verification Deterministic Simulation Testing (DST) ICP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-solofounders-ai生成的代码没人读得懂-验证正从奢侈品变成刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dde5d2398d6bbf62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>AI生成的代碼沒人讀得懂，驗證正從奢侈品變成剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去做系統級驗證成本太高沒人願意做，現在同樣的算力花銷能換來和最嚴苛測試一樣的可靠性，不做反而說不過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">軟件驗證</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Agents Love Supabase AEO Vitess Multigress declarative schema MVCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-latentspace-企业数据库几乎不会迁移-新客户才是真正能赢的战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/303ec709f9a48d84-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>企業數據庫幾乎不會遷移：新客戶才是真正能贏的戰場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Supabase 內部數據顯示企業幾乎不會把生產數據庫搬家，這決定了他們的增長策略是搶佔綠地新項目，而不是攻克巨頭的存量客戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據庫基建</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom of Action: America&#x27;s ASI Strategy, w/ RAND&#x27;s Joel Predd, Ben Boudreaux &amp; Matt Chessen freedom of action strategy wonder weapon pivot factor MAIM (Mutual Assured AI Malfunction)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-28-cogrev-智库说美国现在押注任何一种ai超级智能战略都太早/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5141cc7bc908a3d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>智庫說美國現在押注任何一種AI超級智能戰略都太早</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七種AI戰略各有清晰的贏法和陰暗結局，但沒人能靠證據分出哪個對，於是RAND的建議是現在把各戰略都用得上的基礎能力先攢出來，而不是提前站隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI國家戰略</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>"]